# Chapter 5
HUMANIZED_PARAS[264] = 'This project successfully developed and evaluated SOLAR SCAN, an edge-based mobile diagnostic system for detecting and characterizing solar panel defects offline. The fine-tuned YOLOv8 model attained 91.8% Precision, 89.4% Recall, and 92.7% mAP@50 across nine defect classes. Post-training INT8 quantization shrank model weights from 6.3 MB to 3.2 MB, allowing sub-150ms execution on standard phone processors without cellular connections.'

HUMANIZED_PARAS[265] = 'The Double-Layer Validation Gatekeeper blocked invalid test uploads, preventing false alarms and unnecessary battery use. The Wafer Thermodynamics Engine estimated cell temperatures and wattage losses matching theoretical models within tight margins. Usability testing with 12 solar technicians and engineering students yielded an average SUS score of 84.3 out of 100, which Bangor et al. (2009) rate as Grade A Excellent, demonstrating that the system is practical and field-ready.'

HUMANIZED_PARAS[267] = 'Edge-Optimized YOLOv8 Model: A custom YOLOv8 nano model quantized to 3.2 MB in INT8 TFLite format, running local offline inspections on mobile CPUs at sub-150ms latencies.'
HUMANIZED_PARAS[268] = 'Double-Layer Validation Gatekeeper: A two-stage client-side filter combining COCO object detection with colour-space checks to block invalid images before inference.'
HUMANIZED_PARAS[269] = 'Wafer Thermodynamics Engine: A physical calculation module that converts visual defect boxes into operating temperatures and wattage losses using standard NOCT formulas.'
HUMANIZED_PARAS[270] = 'Interactive Canvas HUD: A responsive interface featuring hover tooltips, imaging modality toggles, Grad-CAM attention maps, and financial ROI estimation.'
HUMANIZED_PARAS[271] = 'Cross-Platform Deployment: A PWA-first system supporting desktop browsers, Android, and iOS devices, with native APK and IPA packaging via Capacitor.'

HUMANIZED_PARAS[273] = 'While the system performs well, it has several practical limitations. The colour histogram filter can reject valid panels under deep outdoor shadows or severe camera glare. The thermodynamics model assumes calm wind conditions and does not yet include live anemometer readings, which would sharpen temperature estimates on windy days. Additionally, technicians must currently capture photos by hand, as live video streaming is not yet supported.'

HUMANIZED_PARAS[274] = 'The software currently calculates ROI losses specifically for standard 400W monocrystalline and polycrystalline modules. It does not yet cover thin-film or bifacial solar technologies. Furthermore, cloud classification through the Google Cloud Vision API requires internet access and an active API key, meaning technicians in remote zones must rely strictly on the offline YOLOv8 engine.'

HUMANIZED_PARAS[276] = 'Future development should focus on linking drone flight telemetry directly into the app for autonomous aerial surveys. Training instance segmentation models (YOLOv8-seg) would allow boundary tracing of fine wafer cracks. Integrating live anemometer wind data would refine thermal cooling calculations. Finally, adding thin-film and bifacial panel datasets would expand the system\'s coverage across diverse solar installations in Ghana.'

HUMANIZED_PARAS[278] = '1. The Energy Commission and Ministry of Energy should introduce standardized digital inspection guidelines for utility solar farms, mandating scheduled checks and electronic maintenance logs.'
HUMANIZED_PARAS[279] = '2. Solar farm operators and utilities should sponsor technical workshops on edge AI, computer vision, and drone thermography for local field crews, in partnership with UENR\'s Department of ITDS.'
HUMANIZED_PARAS[280] = '3. Solar plant managers should use physics-based degradation metrics, specifically wattage losses derived from thermal and visual scans, to prioritize cleaning and panel repairs.'
HUMANIZED_PARAS[281] = '4. Academic institutions, especially UENR, should build open-access defect image repositories collected under Ghanaian climatic conditions to advance local AI research and reduce reliance on external benchmark datasets.'

